        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Location in Image</strong></td>
          <td>Behind Item 2 (the IBC container)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <table class="item-section">
        <tr><th>Description</th></tr>
        <tr><td>
          <p>
            A white Mercedes Sprinter van fitted with a chiller unit is visible behind
            the IBC container described above. The van has formally been used by {{ EH }}
